        },
        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_death",
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "parameters": {
            "linkId": "undead_lord_victim",
            "pos": [
              5.0,
              1.0,
              2.0
            ],
            "name": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.victim",
            "delay": 14
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "[Souls] Start with 2 souls, cap 6; you gain +1 soul per player you personally kill (once per kill). Failed attacks, corpse interactions, and infection injections do not grant souls.",
            "zh_cn": "【灵魂】开局获得 2 魂，上限 6；本人成功击杀玩家 +1 魂（一次击杀记一次）。攻击失败、尸体交互与感染注入均不产生灵魂。",
            "zh_tw": "【靈魂】開局獲得 2 魂，上限 6；本人成功擊殺玩家 +1 魂（一次擊殺記一次）。攻擊失敗、屍體交互與感染注入均不產生靈魂。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "[Raise the Dead] Right-click a real corpse within 3 blocks, spend 1 soul to consume it and raise a Wraith, 20s cooldown. Undertaker fakes, already-raised, or pending-revive corpses cannot be used. Wraith lifetime 90s.",
            "zh_cn": "【亡者复苏】右键 3 格内可见的真实尸体，消耗 1 魂将其销尸并复苏为亡灵，冷却 20 秒。葬仪伪造、已复活或正在复活的尸体不可用。亡灵寿命为 90 秒。",
            "zh_tw": "【亡者復蘇】右鍵 3 格內可見的真實屍體，消耗 1 魂將其銷屍並復蘇為亡靈，冷卻 20 秒。葬儀偽造、已復活或正在復活的屍體不可用。亡靈壽命為 90 秒。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.08,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [
            3,
            0,
            3
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "[Netherfire Summon] Shift+G: spend 1 soul to summon 1 Wraith (60s lifetime) at your side, no corpse needed, 30s cooldown. A failed summon costs no soul or cooldown.",
            "zh_cn": "【冥火招魂】Shift+G：消耗 1 魂，在身边召唤 1 只寿命 60 秒的亡灵，无需尸体，冷却 30 秒；召唤失败不消耗灵魂与冷却。",
            "zh_tw": "【冥火招魂】Shift+G：消耗 1 魂，在身邊召喚 1 只壽命 60 秒的亡靈，無需屍體，冷卻 30 秒；召喚失敗不消耗靈魂與冷卻。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.36,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "[Wraith Cap] Usually at most 4 Wraiths at once (talisman and Netherfire summons count too); corpses-raised and infection-converted Wraiths last 90s. Values are configurable.",
            "zh_cn": "【亡灵上限】通常最多同时拥有 4 只亡灵（召唤符与冥火招魂也计入）；尸体复苏与感染转化的亡灵寿命为 90 秒。",
            "zh_tw": "【亡靈上限】通常最多同時擁有 4 只亡靈（召喚符與冥火招魂也計入）；屍體復蘇與感染轉化的亡靈壽命為 90 秒。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.64,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [
            3,
            0,
            3
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "[Infection] Bone Staff, Wraith attacks, and Plague Mist all add infection. A Wraith injects 16.56% infection per 1.5s hit (doubles to 33.12% with Infection Amplifier) and the target gets 2s Slow on impact; a Bone Staff left-click injects 30% infection. At 100% infection, after 3s the target dies and is instantly converted into a new Wraith (no corpse left); if the Wraith cap is reached, the target just dies and leaves a corpse. Infection drops 2% per second; the Killer team is immune to infection death. Each successful infection injection (Bone Staff or Wraith hit) grants you 25 coins immediately.",
            "zh_cn": "【感染】骨杖、亡灵攻击与瘟疫之雾均会增加玩家的感染值。亡灵每 1.5 秒命中会为玩家注入 16.56% 感染值（佩戴感染增幅器期间翻倍至 33.12%），命中瞬间目标额外获得 2 秒缓慢；骨杖左键命中注入 30% 感染值。感染达到 100% 后 3 秒，目标死亡并立即转化为新的亡灵（不留尸体）；若已达亡灵上限则直接死亡并留下尸体。",
            "zh_tw": "【感染】骨杖、亡靈攻擊與瘟疫之霧均會增加玩家的感染值。亡靈每 1.5 秒命中會為玩家注入 16.56% 感染值（佩戴感染增幅器期間翻倍至 33.12%），命中瞬間目標額外獲得 2 秒緩慢；骨杖左鍵命中注入 30% 感染值。感染達到 100% 後 3 秒，目標死亡並立即轉化為新的亡靈（不留屍體）；若已達亡靈上限則直接死亡並留下屍體。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.92,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
